<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/e_0002/normalization> <http://digistrucmed.org/normalizationMappingStatus> "UNMAPPED" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/tu_0004> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "It is recommended that beta blocker therapy be continued in most patients experiencing a symptomatic exacerbation of HF during chronic maintenance treatment, unless they develop cardiogenic shock, refractory volume overload, or symptomatic bradycardia (Strength of Evidence = C)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/Drug> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
