<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/tu_0013> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit> .
