<http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/na_0007> <http://digistrucmed.org/applicabilityExceptionStatus> "NOT_APPLICABLE" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/e_0003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/MedicationEntity> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/tu_0005> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "A temporary reduction of dose (generally by one-half) in this setting may be considered. Abrupt discontinuation in patients with symptomatic exacerbation should be avoided, unless the situation is life-threatening. (Strength of Evidence = C)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/tu_0008> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "The routine administration of an ARB is not recommended in addition to ACE inhibitor and beta blocker therapy in patients with recent acute MI and LV dysfunction. (Strength of Evidence = A)" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/e_0020> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/ExtractedEntity> .
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_2b6290b9ec9e0199863d75426f4eb32800b1dbc4c89274d4f3da3dea703a1dad_n0032/tu_0018/locator> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/Locator> .
